While in your spectral form from Ghost Walk and for [2, 3, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] turns afterwards, you gain vision of all enemies within radius [8, 8, 9, 9, 10 (TL1-5)].

In addition, at all times you gain the ability to sense undead within [11, 12, 13, 14, 15 (TL1-5)] tiles, and can perceive any foe within [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] tiles of your necrotic minions.
